<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>What Makes the Honey BBQ Basket Different</h2>
  <p>The standard <a href="/items/chicken-strip-basket-4pc">4-Piece Chicken Strip Basket</a> comes with sauce on the side for dipping. The Honey BBQ Basket has the sauce tossed directly onto the strips before serving — the honey BBQ coats every surface of the breading for complete flavor coverage. You still receive a dipping sauce on the side (your choice), but the strips themselves are already sauced.</p>
  <p>The $0.50 premium over the standard basket ($10.49 vs. $9.99) is worth it for guests who want full sauce integration rather than occasional dipping. Find all basket options on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
  <h2>Sauced Basket Options Compared</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Sauced Basket</th><th>Price</th><th>Flavor</th><th>Heat Level</th></tr></thead>
